 dns:=[]byte(body)
 // Build DNS response manually: copy dns, set flags QR etc, QD 1 AN1, question as is, answer pointer A 8.8.8.8. We'll leverage: response = dns[0:2] + 8180 + counts; easier call a python? We can construct based on request known example.com length.
 // Use request packet and transform: response header counts: qd=1 an=1 ns=0 ar=0 (drop OPT from question portion? Request includes OPT additional; parse question ends at offset)
 // Find end of qname
 i:=12; for { l:=int(dns[i]); i++; if l==0 {break}; i+=l }
